      "kind": "idiom",
      "subject": "בן שבע שנים",
      "rationale": "'Morwa wa mengwaga ye šupa' — Seheberu se re 'morwa wa šupa wa dingwaga', lentšu la 'morwa' le ile la latelwa ka ge bohadi bja lona bo le gona."
    },
    {
      "kind": "addition",
      "subject": "wa",
      "rationale": "Mongwalo wa Sepedi o nyaka 'la mmae la Tsivya' — sekopanyi se sengwe se feditšwe ka 'wa' go hlaloša gore Tsivya o tšwa Beere-Sheba."
    },
    {
      "kind": "measurement",
      "subject": "mengwaga",
      "rationale": "Palo ya mengwaga ya bogoši: šupa ge a thoma, masomepedi a buša."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Go e na le mengwaga ye šupa Yoashe ge a thoma go buša, gomme a buša mengwaga ye masomepedi ka Yerushalayime; gomme leina la mmae ⟨wa⟩ Tsivya, wa Beere-Sheba.",
